Add opt-in per-user Dovecot mail-crypt encryption, credential-wrapped mailbox
keys, enrolled app tokens, password rewrapping, dedicated recovery tokens, and
an offline encrypted Maildir-copy tool. Encrypted accounts support webmail
unlock after password or passkey sign-in and OAuth grants with client-held
unlock secrets. Indexes remain in memory; see the mailbox encryption
documentation for activation, migration and backup requirements.
